# Prompt
If config file is not found in the default folder, we can want to find it
in above folders in some cases.
Algorithm:
create method findConfigFile(startingFolder : string) : string | null 

Try to find file svi.json in starting folder; if found, then return the path to the
found config.
If not found, go one level up, and try again.
If not found in any folder, return null.